om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124210/extras/918637e70871547713cb221cc6990e19.mp4?t=1751660272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the ranks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge comes with a specific rank level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the ranks by mastering each challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become the <strong>Ultimate Master</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
